<section id="what" class="section-pad section-border-top hero-strata">
	<div class="container">
		<h2>What CairnCMS provides.</h2>
		<div class="prose mt-4">
			<p>
				CairnCMS is a headless CMS with a runtime-defined schema, a full admin interface, and REST
				+ GraphQL APIs. It runs entirely on your infrastructure with no mandatory vendor
				dependencies. You define your data model at runtime, manage content through a clean UI,
				and retain full ownership of your deployment.
			</p>
			<p>
				The project is built on Directus 10 and extended with quality-of-life improvements,
				including config-as-code support that the Directus community requested for three years
				without delivery. CairnCMS is maintained under GPLv3 by a community that values stability
				over novelty.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="card callout-moss mt-4">
			<div class="card-body">
				<p class="eyebrow mb-2">By design</p>
				<ul class="mb-0 ps-3">
					<li>Telemetry is stripped from the source entirely, not gated behind an opt-out flag.</li>
					<li>The project is community-maintained, with no venture funding or investor-driven roadmap.</li>
					<li>Your deployment runs without registration keys, license checks, or feature gates.</li>
					<li>The GPLv3 license is permanent. Contributions use DCO sign-off, so relicensing is structurally impossible.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
